# Power: the master switch cuts power with no warning, so the box must come back
# from whatever it last saved. Positions are saved every 10 s while playing and
# immediately on pause, lift and volume change.

# Clean shutdown (low battery, `poweroff`): save right away.
tap story-440
wait 42s
power off
expect cmd pause
expect cmd persist
expect led shutting-down

# Switch flipped off mid-play, then on again: at most 10 s of position is lost.
power cut
expect idle
expect volume 40
expect position story-440 42s     # saved by the clean shutdown above
tap story-440
expect cmd play
wait 25s                         # saved at ~10 s and ~20 s into this play
power cut
expect position story-440 62s    # 42 + 20; the last 5 s are lost
tap song-660
expect cmd play

# Settings changed just before the cut survive: they are saved immediately.
click vol-down
click vol-down
power cut
expect volume 30
